{"data":{"appliedContentFormat":"html","id":"1392155","key":"ENG-9486","fields":{"summary":"SmartAlert emails not inserted into table SmartAlertProcess for cohesion-mode clients after September Feature Release","description":"<h2 data-local-id="9884459c6dcb">Summary</h2><p data-local-id="e971fc3c43c6">SmartAlert emails are being sent but <code>SmartAlertProcess</code> table records are not being inserted for cohesion-mode clients. The issue started affecting all cohesion-mode clients with active SmartAlerts after the September Feature Release deployment (~09/24/2026).</p><h2 data-local-id="9bb296da90af">Symptoms</h2><ul data-local-id="ca3f52bf0230"><li data-local-id="9f67e5d10f6e"><p data-local-id="490a75a1bfb0"><code>NettrackSmartAlertActivity</code> in HATR fails with HTTP 500</p></li><li data-local-id="ca72003aeb8d"><p data-local-id="67fef373cab5">Step 13 (<code>&quot;13. AlertName=...|EmailGroup=...&quot;</code>) is logged in Grafana</p></li><li data-local-id="6394fffab6aa"><p data-local-id="0019935cc38b">Step 13b (<code>&quot;13b. EMAIL SENT&quot;</code>) is NOT logged</p></li><li data-local-id="3b2c37e62ede"><p data-local-id="d3b5f4b82c3c">Emails ARE delivered to recipients (confirmed by Infra)</p></li><li data-local-id="df2d892409ef"><p data-local-id="b56d3af8363a">No row inserted into <code>SmartAlertProcess</code> — alerts will re-fire on next case save</p></li></ul><h2 data-local-id="4ada2388a05c">Root Cause</h2><p data-local-id="32bb830f9e9b"><strong>Two-part cause:</strong></p><ol data-local-id="6c1574261a3e"><li data-local-id="bb6f4e899b12"><p data-local-id="508df827c0ac"><strong>ENG-7181 (PR #57544, deployed ~09/24)</strong> added <code>targetFramework=&quot;4.8&quot;</code> to <code>&lt;httpRuntime&gt;</code> in <code>Sources/Incident/Web/web.config</code>. This switched the ASP.NET synchronization context from the legacy permissive model (pre-4.5) to the modern single-threaded model (4.5+).</p></li><li data-local-id="821656338444"><p data-local-id="3156298aa202"><code>SendGridEmail.vb</code> (<code>Sources/Incident/Components/LPSBO/SendGridEmail.vb</code>) calls <code>Await client.SendEmailAsync(msg)</code> without <code>ConfigureAwait(False)</code>. In the modern sync context, this <code>Await</code> captures the ASP.NET sync context for its continuation. When <code>SmartAlert.vb</code> calls <code>SendEmailAsync(...).GetAwaiter().GetResult()</code> (blocking the request thread), the continuation cannot re-enter the now-blocked sync context — <strong>deadlock</strong>.</p></li></ol><p data-local-id="49c15f66def2">IIS times out the hung request and returns HTTP 500 to HATR. SendGrid has already dispatched the email before the deadlock (explaining why emails arrive), but the code after <code>.GetAwaiter().GetResult()</code> — including the <code>SmartAlertProcess</code> INSERT — never executes.</p><h2 data-local-id="aba4221229e8">Fix</h2><p data-local-id="27c2b1c312fb">Add <code>.ConfigureAwait(False)</code> to both <code>Await</code> calls in <code>SendGridEmail.SendEmailAsync</code> (<code>Sources/Incident/Components/LPSBO/SendGridEmail.vb</code>):</p><pre data-local-id="1943ad350281"><code class="language-vb">&#039; Line 135
Dim responseSend = Await client.SendEmailAsync(msg).ConfigureAwait(False)

&#039; Line 139
_logger.Warn($&quot;... Body: {Await responseSend.Body.ReadAsStringAsync().ConfigureAwait(False)}&quot;)</code></pre><h2 data-local-id="913ff22601c3">Impact</h2><p data-local-id="779c44d6e034">All cohesion-mode clients with active SmartAlerts configured. Last <code>SmartAlertProcess</code> records across affected clients: 09/24/2026.</p>","status":{"name":"Development Complete","statusCategory":{"name":"In Progress"}},"assignee":{"accountId":"6201ac57e5caff0070e1e981","displayName":"Kiran Vadday"},"reporter":{"accountId":"6201ac57e5caff0070e1e981","displayName":"Kiran Vadday"},"priority":{"name":"High"},"issuetype":{"id":"1","name":"Bug"},"created":"2026-09-27T19:19:04.118-0400","updated":"2026-10-07T09:06:45.489-0400","labels":["2026","lpguys-deployed-prod","lpguys-deployed-test"],"subtasks":[],"comment":{"total":7},"issuelinks":[{"id":"494564","type":{"name":"Problem/Incident","inward":"is caused by","outward":"causes"},"outwardIssue":{"key":"RCS-29123","fields":{"summary":"Ahold-Delhaize - Smart Alerts are not generating today","status":{"name":"Under Customer Review"}}}},{"id":"494635","type":{"name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to"},"outwardIssue":{"key":"ENG-9533","fields":{"summary":"QA Manual Test ENG-9486 Smart Alert History","status":{"name":"Done"}}}},{"id":"494725","type":{"name":"Relates","inward":"relates to","outward":"relates to"},"outwardIssue":{"key":"ENG-9589","fields":{"summary":"QA Automation (ENG-9486): SmartAlert emails not inserted into SmartAlertProcess for cohesion-mode clients after September Feature Release","status":{"name":"Backlog"}}}},{"id":"494817","type":{"name":"Action item","inward":"action item from","outward":"has action item"},"inwardIssue":{"key":"ENG-8698","fields":{"summary":"Stater Bros. - Legal Follow Up Smart Alert not working","status":{"name":"In Testing"}}}}],"customFields":{"[CHART] Date of First Response":{"id":"customfield_21746","value":"2026-09-30T12:32:00.571-0400"},"QA Engineer":{"id":"cust